{
  "name": "When a Pipedrive deal is lost, re-engage the contact 90 days later",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## When a Pipedrive deal is lost, re-engage the contact 90 days later\n\n### How it works\nA lost deal is often a deal for later. The Pipedrive Trigger fires when a deal changes; only deals that just turned lost go on. The workflow waits wait_days (90 by default) inside n8n, then reads the deal's contact person, so a changed email is picked up. The person joins your re-engagement campaign with {{lost_reason}} and {{deal_title}} as variables, and a note on the deal records it. Every address is checked before it joins; people who are blocked or unsubscribed are never added.\n\nYour own contacts cost no credits.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Add a Pipedrive credential to **Deal updated**, **Get the contact** and **Note on the deal**.\n4. Set wait_days in **Settings**, pick the campaign in **Add to re-engagement campaign** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nSkip some lost reasons with a filter, or use a shorter wait for small deals.",
        "height": 609,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "ece027a5-4a73-43f6-ac47-68afc25846f4",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -360
      ]
    },
